<title>USA: Riverdale, Ill., bonds yield 7.95 pct in 2024.</title>
<headline>Riverdale, Ill., bonds yield 7.95 pct in 2024.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it tentatively priced $8.6 million Riverdale, Ill., revenue bonds to yield 7.95 percent in the sole 2024 maturity.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>Village of Riverdale, Illinois</p>
<p>RE: $8,585,000*</p>
<p>% Environmental Improvement Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>(Acme Mentals Incorporated Project)</p>
<p>Series 1996A</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: B1		    S&amp;P: B</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 04/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>04/01/2024		8,585M    7.95  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 04/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 04/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE The award is expected Wednesday, September 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 25, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
